# Global gitignore (linked via core.excludesfile).
# NOTE: gitignore uses glob patterns, not regex.
# `**/name/` matches the folder at ANY depth (nested subdirectories).
# Tailored for: Go, Rust, Python, TypeScript + secrets & dev tooling.

# --- OS / system artifacts (anywhere) ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/
._*

# --- Go ---
bin/
**/bin/
coverage.out
**/coverage.out
coverage.html
**/coverage.html
*.prof
**/*.prof
**/dist/
vendor/
**/vendor/

# --- Rust (Cargo) ---
target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock.orig
**/*.orig
rustc-**/
**/rustc-**/
.rs/
**/.rs/
*.pdb

